    -0.64 |                                9.04  |", "data_inicio": "2013-04-01", "data_fim": "2015-01-01", "avaliacao_analise": true, "description_avaliacao_analise": "The analyst correctly identified the key weaknesses: negative EPS in 50% of the periods, highly volatile operating cash-flow (from -0.32 to 9.75), leverage consistently above 3.4\u00d7, and net margins persistently below 3.3%. These metrics collectively justify a \"Poor\" classification, as they indicate both weak profitability and elevated financial risk.", "interacao": 1}, "AZUL4": null, "AZZA3": {"classification": "Fair", "analysis": "Revenue and EBITDA swing but show no clear trend; net margin ~11 % is thin, leverage stable at ~1.4\u00d7 and debt/EBITDA <0.7\u00d7 keeps risk moderate. P/E compressed from 29\u00d7 to 21\u00d7, signalling past over-valuation rather than improving fundamentals. Recovery in Q1-14 is welcome but one quarter does not offset the earlier 20 % revenue drop and volatile cash generation; overall picture is mixed rather than deteriorating.", "tic": "AZZA3", "dados_fundamentalistas": "|    |   receita_liquida |   ebitda |   lucro_por_acao | datas               | tic   |   alavancagem_financeira |   margem_liquida |   pre\u00e7o_lucro |   pre\u00e7o_vpa |   fluxo_caixa_operacional |   divida_liquida_ebitda |   aumento_reducao_caixa_equivalentes |\n|---:|------------------:|---------:|-----------------:|:--------------------|:------|-------------------------:|-----------------:|--------------:|------------:|--------------------------:|------------------------:|-------------------------------------:|\n|  1 |            237.64 |    40.48 |             0.33 | 2013-09-30 00:00:00 | AZZA3 |                     1.43 |            0.116 |         29    |        6.68 |                     12.44 |                    0.65 |                               -0.912 |\n|  2 |            266.67 |    46.76 |             0.33 | 2013-12-31 00:00:00 | AZZA3 |                     1.47 |            0.114 |         26.98 |        6.02 |                     10.77 |                    0.62 |                                3.23  |\n|  3 |            257.6  |    43.59 |             0.37 | 2014-03-31 00:00:00 | AZZA3 |                     1.37 |            0.115 |         20.44 |        4.39 |                     14.09 |                    0.53 |                                3.04  |\n|  4 |            213.43 |    27.29 |             0.2  | 2014-06-30 00:00:00 | AZZA3 |                     1.41 |            0.111 |         20.4  |        4.16 |                     33.88 |                    0.54 |                               -2.81  |\n|  5 |            253.75 |    42.28 |             0.36 | 2014-09-30 00:00:00 | AZZA3 |                     1.34 |            0.112 |         23.91 |        4.99 |                      8.83 |                    0.43 |                                1.58  |\n|  6 |            296.1  |    51.43 |             0.38 | 2014-12-31 00:00:00 | AZZA3 |                     1.41 |            0.113 |         20.9  |        4.33 |                     33.86 |                    0.49 |                               -5.98  |", "data_inicio": "2013-04-01", "data_fim": "2015-01-01", "avaliacao_analise": true, "description_avaliacao_analise": "The analyst correctly identifies the key facts: revenue and EBITDA are volatile with no sustained direction, the net margin is consistently thin (~11 %), leverage is stable and moderate (1.4\u00d7, debt/EBITDA <0.7\u00d7), and the P/E compression from 29\u00d7 to 21\u00d7 is driven more by price decline than by earnings growth. The observation that one-quarter recovery does not offset the prior 20 % revenue drop and erratic cash flow is also accurate. These points justify the 'Fair' classification, as the fundamentals are neither strong nor clearly deteriorating, but rather mixed and unstable.", "interacao": 3}, "BALM4": {"classification": "Poor", "analysis": "EBITDA margin has compressed from 24% to 14.6%, EPS collapsed 89% to 0.45, and operating cash flow turned negative. Extreme valuation dips (P/E 0.96, P/B 0.19) signal distress, while leverage is moderate but insufficient to offset collapsing profitability and cash generation.", "tic": "BALM4", "dados_fundamentalistas": "|    |   receita_liquida |   ebitda |   lucro_por_acao | datas               | tic   |   alavancagem_financeira |   margem_liquida |   pre\u00e7o_lucro |   pre\u00e7o_vpa |   fluxo_caixa_operacional |   divida_liquida_ebitda |   aumento_reducao_caixa_equivalentes |\n|---:|------------------:|---------:|-----------------:|:--------------------|:------|-------------------------:|-----------------:|--------------:|------------:|--------------------------:|------------------------:|-------------------------------------:|\n|  1 |             27.05 |     5.86 |             4.23 | 2013-09-30 00:00:00 | BALM4 |                     1.79 |            0.103 |          6.95 |        1.18 |                      2.91 |                    0.46 |                                2.74  |\n|  2 |             26.44 |     5.42 |             3.45 | 2013-12-31 00:00:00 | BALM4 |                     1.79 |            0.107 |          8.89 |        1.49 |                      5.32 |                    0.57 |                                6.58  |\n|  3 |             31.42 |     5.31 |             2.91 | 2014-03-31 00:00:00 | BALM4 |                     1.84 |            0.121 |          8.21 |        1.59 |                      1.29 |                    0.55 |                                0.054 |\n|  4 |             27.43 |     6.57 |             3.72 | 2014-06-30 00:00:00 | BALM4 |                     1.84 |            0.127 |          0.96 |        0.19 |                      3.06 |                    0.41 |                                1.36  |\n|  5 |             27.57 |     4.02 |             0.18 | 2014-09-30 00:00:00 | BALM4 |                     1.81 |            0.103 |         12.27 |        1.93 |                     -2.51 |                    0.43 |                               -5.2   |\n|  6 |             30.65 |     5.51 |             0.45 | 2014-12-31 00:00:00 | BALM4 |                     1.79 |            0.108 |          9.2  |        1.55 |                      2.56 |                    0.41 |                                1.67  |", "data_inicio": "2013-04-01", "data_fim": "2015-01-01", "avaliacao_analise": false, "description_avaliacao_analise": "The analyst\u2019s analysis contains multiple factual errors that invalidate the conclusion:\n1. EBITDA margin was never 24 %; it peaked at 21.7 % (6.57/27.43) and ended at 18.0 % (5.51/30.65), so the claimed compression to 14.6 % is incorrect.\n2. Operating cash flow did not turn negative; the reported values are consistently positive (2.91, 5.32, 1.29, 3.06, 2.56). The analyst seems to have confused the negative change in cash (-2.51) with operating cash flow.\n3. The extreme valuation multiples (P/E 0.96, P/B 0.19) occur only in 2014-Q2 and are clearly data errors, not distress signals; adjacent quarters show normal ranges (P/E 8-12, P/B 1.5-1.9). A competent review would flag these outliers instead of treating them as fundamental evidence.\n4. EPS declined 89 % relative to the peak, but the absolute level is still positive (0.45), and the drop is largely explained by a margin squeeze of only ~3 pp (EBITDA margin 18 % \u2192 15 %) combined with higher financial leverage, not a collapse.\n5. Net debt/EBITDA is 0.41\u00d7, indicating low leverage, not \"moderate but insufficient.\"\nBecause the key supporting claims are factually wrong, the classification of \"Poor\" is not justified based on the provided data.", "interacao": 3}, "BAUH4": null, "BAZA3": null, "BBAS3": null, "BBSE3": null, "BBDC3": null, "BBDC4": null, "BGIP3": null, "BGIP4": null, "BIOM3": null, "BLAU3": null, "BMEB3": null, "BMEB4": null, "BMKS3": null, "BMIN3": null, "BMIN4": null, "BMOB3": null, "BPAN4": null, "BPAC11": null, "BPAC3": null, "BPAC5": null